      "writeup": "<h2>From worms to cyberwar</h2><p>What began in 1988 with the accidental havoc of the <b>Morris worm</b> evolved into deliberate statecraft: sabotage of industrial equipment, billion-dollar ransomware outbreaks, and supply-chain compromises reaching the heart of governments.</p><p>Each band links an attack’s <i>attributed</i> origin to its primary target — attribution in cyberspace is contested by nature, so treat origins as best public assessments. Click a band for the incident’s story; the darker bands mark NotPetya and SolarWinds, the two most consequential operations so far.</p>",
